1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,651
This is a recording of the new billing screen.

2
00:00:03,651 --> 00:00:10,028
It is the real screen, talking to a stand-in backend, so no real payment is involved.

3
00:00:11,128 --> 00:00:19,776
A tenant on the free Trial plan sees the Premium plan, with its price and its tax spelled out, and a Subscribe now button.

4
00:00:21,289 --> 00:00:24,213
Pressing Subscribe asks for confirmation.

5
00:00:24,213 --> 00:00:34,771
It states the monthly amount, that the tenant will approve in their UPI app, and that the plan starts only once Razorpay confirms the first payment.

6
00:00:37,658 --> 00:00:45,003
The tenant is sent to Razorpay in a new tab, and this page shows the request as Pending authorization.

7
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:49,035
The plan has not changed, and nothing has been credited.

8
00:00:50,545 --> 00:00:53,002
Now the stand-in plays Razorpay.

9
00:00:53,002 --> 00:00:58,072
First the mandate is approved, and the page shows Payment pending.

10
00:00:58,072 --> 00:01:00,837
Then the first payment is confirmed.

11
00:01:00,837 --> 00:01:08,287
The page finds this out by asking the server every few seconds, not because the tenant came back.

12
00:01:08,287 --> 00:01:13,280
Only now does it show Active, and the plan and the wallet change.

13
00:01:14,792 --> 00:01:21,880
The payment appears in the history, with how it was paid, its reference, and the tax it included.

14
00:01:23,384 --> 00:01:27,617
Invoices are fetched on request, and each has a link.

15
00:01:29,124 --> 00:01:30,589
Now a payment fails.

16
00:01:30,589 --> 00:01:38,210
The screen turns red, says the payment didn't go through, and says it will be tried again automatically.

17
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:44,366
The failed attempt is listed in the history with its reason, and it adds no credits.

18
00:01:45,874 --> 00:01:50,645
Once the retry succeeds, the automatic payment is active again.

19
00:01:50,645 --> 00:01:54,887
The tenant can cancel at any time, after a confirmation.

20
00:01:54,887 --> 00:02:03,370
The plan stays active until the end of the period already paid for, and the status reads Cancellation scheduled.

21
00:02:04,871 --> 00:02:11,334
To be clear about what you saw: the screen is real, but Razorpay was played by a stand-in.

22
00:02:11,334 --> 00:02:17,078
The next step is to run the written test checklist against Razorpay's test mode.

